cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "Milk-run inbound VRP: contractual parameters as the environmental lever"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for an open vehicle routing problem on a many-to-one inbound
  collection network with vehicles stationed at the suppliers, a load-dependent
  CO2e objective kept linear by an affine emission factor, and an analysis of
  the contractual cap on stops per route and the consolidation threshold as
  environmental decision variables.
type: software
